       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-KINO-MULT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-KINO-MULT-PROOFS.
           05  WS-M-FOLD-RECON-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FOURIER-DECOMP-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MULTI-VIEW-SNR-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-KMULT-LATENCY-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-KMULT-SEAL-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-KINO-MULT-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PKM-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PKM-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-RECON-AND-DECOMP.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-SNR-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PKM-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-RECON-AND-DECOMP.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-M-FOLD-RECON-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FOURIER-DECOMP-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-SNR-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MULTI-VIEW-SNR-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-KMULT-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PKM-PROOFS.
           IF WS-M-FOLD-RECON-OK = 1 AND
              WS-FOURIER-DECOMP-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MULTI-VIEW-SNR-OK = 1 AND
              WS-KMULT-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-KMULT-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PKM-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PKM-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PKM-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PKM-CODE.
